## Model orchestration

For substantial or risky multi-model work, use the `model-orchestration` skill when available. It owns the current catalog, capability differences, scoring, quota fallback, and explicit-required-model stop rules. Otherwise act directly in this session.

When running as a leaf under another orchestrator, do the assigned work directly and do not re-delegate; the parent owns planning and review.
